[Commit Message Generation]

LANGUAGE: Spanish (Español). NEVER write commit messages in English.

FORMAT: Conventional Commits (feat, fix, chore, refactor, docs, test).

SUBJECT: One line in Spanish explaining WHY the change was made, not a file list.

BODY: Optional, also in Spanish. No English bullet points.

EXAMPLES:
- fix(inventarios): Guardar y Enviar siguen el patrón de Cobros con validación al pulsar
- feat(cobros): se valida retención incompleta antes de enviar con modal y hints en la lista

INVALID (do not use):
- fix(inventarios): enhance stock management and UI feedback
- Updated the inventory activities component to...

If the diff suggests English wording, translate the message to Spanish before outputting.
